  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "三个可替换的协作者",
      "items": [
        "Luban 构造参数默认 JpegCompressor / ImageLoader / CompressionCalculator，三者都是普通类或接口，可在测试中替换",
        "解耦后压缩主流程只剩 decode → calculate → compress → 落盘，主文件不足 350 行"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "两套调用 API",
      "items": [
        "协程 API：Luban.compress / compressTo / luban { } DSL 都以 suspend 函数返回 Result<File>",
        "回调 API：LubanCompat.Builder().load(...).setCompressListener(...).launch() 返回 CompressionTask，可依 Lifecycle ON_DESTROY 自动取消"
      ]
    }
  ]
